{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"7e509e4e-c966-478f-b3a5-37ff82ebd248","status":"SUCCESS","response":"## Added Hedera SDK \u0026 Transfer Script\n\n**Key changes**\n- Updated `package.json` to include `@hashgraph/sdk` **2.81.0**.\n- Created `src/transfer.ts` that:\n  1. Loads `.env` variables (`OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY`, `RECIPIENT_ID`, `VALID_START`).\n  2. Builds an offline `TransferTransaction`:\n     - Sends **1 hbar** from the operator to the recipient.\n     - Uses node `0.0.3`.\n     - Sets memo `invoice 42`.\n     - Creates a `TransactionId` with the provided `VALID_START` timestamp.\n  3. Signs with the operator’s DER‑encoded ED25519 private key.\n  4. Prints the signed transaction bytes as a hexadecimal string (no network calls).\n\n**Run the script**\n\n```bash\nnpm install          # fetch @hashgraph/sdk and other deps\nnpm run transfer     # executes `tsx src/transfer.ts`\n```\n\nThe command outputs a single hex line representing the signed transaction.\n\n**Verification**\n\nRunning `npx tsc --noEmit` succeeds, confirming that the TypeScript code compiles without errors.  \n\nAll modifications are recorded in **ANSWER.md** for reference.\n","duration_seconds":49.285666,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":10458,"output_tokens":5121,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":99200,"total_tokens":15579}}}
